# --- Dataset & generated outputs ---
# data/raw and data/processed are regenerable via download_dataset.py /
# prepare_dataset.py and are large -- not committed.
# results/*.json and charts/*.png ARE committed on purpose: the README
# embeds the chart images directly (broken links on GitHub otherwise), and
# the raw results JSON back up this repo's "raw numbers included" claim
# with something a reviewer can actually open, not just regenerate.
data/raw/
data/processed/

